+/// session list, the session's two ranges, the `inode:` scan, the cursor read and one ledger page
+/// — a hop each — plus two hops per commit and one per delete, so 32 half-milliseconds spans
+/// "before the first pass", every gap inside it, and later passes; the coverage properties prove
+/// the gaps that matter are reached.
+const STAGED_NEMESIS_SPAN: u32 = 32;
